:INFO
Art. 44a Transitional provision to the Amendment of 23 November 2023
Radio equipment that does not meet the requirements of Articles 7 paragraph 2bis, 19 paragraphs 2 letter d and 3 and 24a may be placed on the market until the following dates:
a. laptops: until 27 April 2026;
b. other radio equipment: until 27 December 2024.
|

:NOTE
Art. 44a — Inserted by No I of the O of 22 Nov. 2023, in force since 1 Jan. 2024 (AS 2023 720). Correction of 15 Jan. 2024 (AS 2024 22).
Correction of 15 Aug. 2024 (AS 2024 415).
